  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5d9f1182fc3e41e8a2ae214deeea00d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Abysses.Level.PuzzleObjective
  ShowTopMostFoldoutHeaderGroup: 1
  floor: 3
  quadrant: -1
  label: "Cloisons \xE9tanches"
  labelEnglish: Watertight doors
  hints:
  - "Une fuite inonde la coque des ballasts : l'eau passe d'un compartiment \xE0
    l'autre par les portes ouvertes."
  - "Un seul plongeur a le PLAN ; les commandes des portes sont r\xE9parties entre
    vous. Il doit dire qui ferme quoi."
  - 'Trois fermetures seulement : fermez toutes les portes entre l''eau et le sec
    avant qu''elle n''atteigne la POMPE (jaune).'
  hintsEnglish:
  - 'A leak is flooding the ballast hull: water moves between compartments through
    open doors.'
  - Only one diver has the MAP; the door controls are spread among you. They must
    say who closes what.
  - 'Only three closures: close every door between water and dry before it reaches
    the PUMP (yellow).'
